{"sba-nogi-46438":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"  EX大衆発売中です！ 中田のソログラビアあります！！！！ 久々にグラビアありがたいですね めちゃくちゃいい感じだと思いますし楽しく撮影させてもらいました 一部、ホテルで撮影したんだけどいいお部屋だったな～ 泊まってみたい...いくらするんだろう...（笑）  オフショットもいいのいろいろあったのでまたどこかで載せるかも！ "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF6ZVFSCYSQ8SW43S5PW73M","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">     もうすぐ沈金ですよ～ 聴いてねー！ なかだかな"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-30344":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NHK-FM「AKB48の私たちの物語」\n今日22時からです！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/01/29/6955071/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりちゃ、さゆにゃん、ゆったん、なーちゃん、若、中田"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このメンツ何か思い浮かぶ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと足らないけどね(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は初わたものでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったから聴いて欲しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/01/29/6955071/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐだよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はサイン会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13thシングルの特典イベントだね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/01/29/6955071/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"各メンバー5名ずつなので\n当たったかたおめでとうございます＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も中田がサインさせていただいたものを\n晒しますと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色紙\nハチマキ\nワインボトル\nユニフォーム\nマフラータオル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です` ･ω･ ´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり\n長くゆっくりお話しできるのでいいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/01/29/6955071/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/01/29/6955071/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はサイン会でしたが\n明日は個別だよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13thで言うと関東は最後になりますかね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宿題です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/01/29/6955071/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/01/29/6955071/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒト以外の動物や植物で生まれ変わるとしたら何になりたい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/01/29/6955071/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近面白い番組ある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ループしすぎて話題ないとき\n初めましてで何話したらいいかわかんないとき\n答えを教えてください(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ち物チェック"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"□握手券\n□身分証明書\n(□トレード用の写真等)\n(□メンバーへのプレゼント)\n(□グッズ買うためのお金)\n□推しに対する愛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってるね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/01/29/6955071/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/01/29/6955071/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛ちゃんきゃー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/01/29/6955071/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-17546":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/03/27/4848074/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とタイトルに書いてあったから\n変顔してると思ったか！┗(^o^ )┓<33"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかの真顔だぜ！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っっっぬっっふ！！！！！┏( .-. ┏ ) ┓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/03/27/4848074/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばそわヽ(^ω^)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、メンバーのブログで変な顔するのが好きなボクです(* ^o^ *)！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみのブログでは、変顔するボクと\n更にその後ろで変顔するかずみん（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなつブログでは、ハンドパワー！\n小悪魔を倒す天使"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/03/27/4848074/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、まなつには「にゃんさん」と呼ばれているであります／(^o^)＼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかのキャラクターみたいっ（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、みなさん、舞台のほうのブログも読んでくれて有難うo(^o^)oうぎうぎ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問にこたえるよ(ミ＾o＾ミ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼  Name  :  ノッティングヒル  さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎  よく飲む飲み物は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"豆乳と牛乳。\n毎日飲んでますっ(* ^o^ *)！\n今も、豆乳飲みながらブログ書いてるー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎   好きな食べ物は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バタークッキーと、バニラアイスと、パンケーキと、ドーナツと、メロンと、スイカと、いちご！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と、お肉o(^o^)o www\nハンバーグと唐揚げと焼肉っ（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさゆにゃん＊＊"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/03/27/4848074/0002.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(。・ω・。)正義！"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-1837":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"うわぁwwww"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わぁぁww  !!w(゜□゜)w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今 録画していた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『カミスン』と言う音楽番組に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(関西では流れていないんだ(ノ_・。))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前の似顔絵会の時の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・まひろ★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ななせ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・さゆりん★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・いこまちゃん☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・いっちきれなちゃん★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が出た出たぁー (゜◇゜)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/15/81319e.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わいわい ))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"びっくりな気持ち ・ε"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます ω"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上から.まりか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/15/entryimage.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/15/entryimage.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まひろ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/15/entryimage.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です〓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/15/dvc00905.jpg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-38545":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"明治神宮野球場で\nヤクルト対カープ戦を観てきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2017/05/11/5983098/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左:ひめ 右:まま"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々の野球観戦！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日の試合は両チーム共に\n点の取り合いが激しくて\nドキドキしながら応援してました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"野球観戦ももちろん楽しかったし\nここでライブするんだ～と思うと\nスタンドに座ってるの不思議な気分。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アリーナまでの距離感とか\n試合中なのにライブのことが\n気になって気になって(´,,•ω•,,｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ままが試合観戦にハマったらしく\n小声で歌ってて可愛いなと思いました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかマツダスタジアムで\n試合観戦したいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会でリクエストが多かったので\n望日香ちゃん日記書きます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2017/05/11/5983098/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめの最近のお気に入りはこの写メ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピンクの座布団が落ち着くみたいで\nよくここで遊んでます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見て欲しいのはおてて！\n小さなおててで一生懸命抑えながら\n骨のガム噛んでます♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2017/05/11/5983098/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい可愛い～～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとわかりにくいですが\nオムツ履いてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お出かけする時に\nひめが無理やり履かせたんですが\n気になって気になって仕方ないそうで。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2017/05/11/5983098/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく背中擦り付けてゴロゴロしてます♡\nお洋服着た時だけやるから\nなんかモゾモゾして落ち着かないのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我が家はお洋服着せる派で\nモニちゃんクローゼットコーナーを\n作ってるほどです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他のワンちゃんより小柄気味なので\nお洋服もチワワちゃんサイズ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人懐っこいので\nお散歩してると誰にでも\n遊んで！遊んで！と寄って来ます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はワンちゃん幼稚園に預けていたので\nワンちゃん同士でも\n仲良くできるようになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーで会ったのは今のところ\n万理華、さゆ、愛未ちゃん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2017/05/11/5983098/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お鼻や前足に葉っぱくっ付いてます\n周りの葉っぱ全部食べてやろうとしてた\n食いしん坊モニちゃんなのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上、姉バカ日記でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"～お知らせ～\n雑誌\n5/15 EX大衆 6月号\n6/6 漫画アクション"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LIVE\n7/1～ 乃木坂46真夏の全国ツアー2017"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リリース\n5/24 乃木坂46 3rdアルバム\n「生まれてから初めて見た夢」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(＊´・ω・＊)"}],"source":"archive"}}